---
import {companionState,companionOrder} from '../../lib/studio/companion';
const {project,cards=[],sections=[]}=Astro.props;
const entries=await Promise.all(companionOrder(sections).map(async(section:any)=>({section,state:await companionState(section,cards.find((c:any)=>c.id===section.card_id),sections)})));
---
<section data-chapter-panel="companion" hidden><p class="studio-eyebrow">Section six · The Companion</p><h2>Write the guidebook for your deck</h2><p><a href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/guidebook-outline/`}>Set up your card entries</a></p><p>What will help them understand what they are holding and feel ready to begin? Your companion can be concise or expansive. It does not need to explain everything.</p><details><summary>Welcome the reader</summary><p>What brought this deck into being? What is it here to offer? What makes its approach distinctive, and how much freedom does the reader have?</p><p>Your private reflections are resources, not a script. Choose what belongs in reader-facing text; nothing is copied from your journal or foundations automatically.</p></details><div class="companion-create"><a class="studio-button" href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/companion/new/?type=front_matter`}>Write an introduction</a><a class="studio-link-button" href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/companion/new/?type=instructions`}>Write how to use the deck</a><a class="studio-link-button" href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/companion/new/`}>Adapt a card entry</a></div><p><a class="studio-button" href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/final-selection/`}>Choose final cards and sequence</a></p><h3>My Companion Manuscript</h3><p>Review your saved guidebook sections in manuscript order. Select a section to continue editing it.</p><ol class="companion-contents" data-companion-contents>{entries.map(({section,state})=><li><div><small>Manuscript position {section.sort_order} · {state.label}</small><h4><a href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/companion/${section.id}/`}>{section.title}</a></h4><p>{section.card_id?`Card entry: ${cards.find((c:any)=>c.id===section.card_id)?.title??'Source card unavailable'}`:'General reader-facing section'}</p></div></li>)}</ol>{!entries.length?<p>No sections yet. Start with an introduction, instructions or a card entry; there is no required book length.</p>:null}<p><a href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/project-book/?book=manuscript`}>Read your developing manuscript in My Project Workbook</a></p><p><a href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/exports/`}>Open Exports</a></p><p>Source changes ask for review. They never overwrite an adaptation or turn creator approval into a claim of personal editorial review.</p><button type="button" class="studio-button studio-button--secondary" data-chapter="making">Explore The Making</button></section>
<style>section h2{font:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.5rem)/1.2 'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif}section p{line-height:1.75}details{padding:1rem 0;border-top:1px solid #cec9c1}summary{font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.companion-create{display:flex;gap:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:1.5rem 0}.companion-contents{padding-left:1.4rem}.companion-contents li{padding:1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cec9c1}.companion-contents h4{font:400 1.4rem/1.3 'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;margin:.4rem 0}.companion-contents p{font-size:.9rem}.companion-contents small,.companion-review-label{font-size:.8rem;color:#58605d}details article{padding:1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cec9c1}@media(max-width:760px){.companion-create>*{width:100%}}</style>
